      "title": "File:Columned Chamber Siq al-Barid Jordan1502.jpg",
      "pageid": 34055432,
      "revision": 865430221,
      "wikitext": "=={{int:filedesc}}==\n{{Information\n|description={{en|1=The chamber is fronted by two standing columns in antis. There isn't any decoration or carving inside. Below the chamber is a cave-house with three rooms. One room has recessed shelves in the walls. Possibly the columned chamber was the chapel for a memorial cult, and the house below was occupied by whoever was in charge of the rites.}}\n|date=2014-07-17 18:14:30\n|source={{own}}\n|author=[[User:G41rn8|Michael Gunther]]\n|permission=\n|other_versions=\n}}\n\n=={{int:license-header}}==\n{{self|cc-by-sa-4.0}}\n\n[[Category:Triclinium, Siq al-Berid]]",
